  "preamble": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "# DeepSeek Harness 下一版 Agent 总实施规格"
    }
  ],
  "sections": [
    {
      "number": 0,
      "title": "总目标",
      "lineStart": 3,
      "lineEnd": 29,
      "sourceUnits": [
        {
          "line": 3,
          "text": "## 0. 总目标"
        },
        {
          "line": 5,
          "text": "本轮工作的核心目标不是单纯“继续把遗留功能做完”，而是把当前项目重新收敛为："
        },
        {
          "line": 7,
          "text": "> **一套 Harness 核心 + 一套稳定跨端 Contract + 多种 Connection Carrier + 多个轻量 Platform Shell。**"
        },
        {
          "line": 9,
          "text": "Windows、macOS、Linux、Web/PWA、iPhone、iPad、Android 不得继续发展成彼此独立、各自维护 Agent/Session/Remote 逻辑的多个产品。"
        },
        {
          "line": 11,
          "text": "本轮优先级必须遵循："
        },
        {
          "line": 13,
          "text": "**Upstream First > 架构收敛 > 正确性/可靠性 > 安全 > 跨端一致性 > UX > 新功能数量。**"
        },
        {
          "line": 15,
          "text": "最终目标："
        },
        {
          "line": 17,
          "text": "- 最大限度采用 DeepSeek 官方 upstream 当前实现；"
        },
        {
          "line": 18,
          "text": "- 减少 downstream 独有代码；"
        },
        {
          "line": 19,
          "text": "- 降低未来 merge/rebase 冲突；"
        },
        {
          "line": 20,
          "text": "- 避免官方已经实现一套 Desktop 后我们继续维护另一套 Desktop；"
        },
        {
          "line": 21,
          "text": "- Mobile 尽量只承担 Client/Companion/Lite 角色；"
        },
        {
          "line": 22,
          "text": "- Agent、Session、Tool、Approval 等核心语义永远由 Host 权威管理；"
        },
        {
          "line": 23,
          "text": "- 所有跨端操作走统一 Contract；"
        },
        {
          "line": 24,
          "text": "- UI/design token 尽量来自官方 Web Client；"
        },
        {
          "line": 25,
          "text": "- 所有发布、兼容、安全、迁移都有机器可验证证据；"
        },
        {
          "line": 26,
          "text": "- 不再采用“能编译 / 有 APK / 有 EXE = 完成”的验收方式。"
        },
        {
          "line": 28,
          "text": "---"
        }
      ],
      "verificationStatus": "NOT_STARTED",
      "acceptanceProven": false,
      "owner": "官方架构、Host 权威和薄平台壳",
      "candidateEvidence": [
        "docs/architecture.md",
        "ARCHITECTURE_DECISIONS.md"
      ],
      "remaining": "继续按各 owner 核验唯一运行时、Session、RPC 和共享 Client；实验项不等同正式产品验收。",
      "evidenceLimit": "这些路径是已定位的候选证据；尚未逐条证明本节每一项要求，不授予整节 PASS。"
    },
    {
      "number": 1,
      "title": "第一原则：在同步最新 upstream 前禁止继续堆功能",
      "lineStart": 30,
      "lineEnd": 87,
      "sourceUnits": [
        {
          "line": 30,
          "text": "# 1. 第一原则：在同步最新 upstream 前禁止继续堆功能"
        },
        {
          "line": 32,
          "text": "这是下一轮 Agent 接手后的第一条硬性要求。"
        },
        {
          "line": 34,
          "text": "## 1.1 必须先完成 upstream refresh"
        },
        {
          "line": 36,
          "text": "开始任何新功能前："
        },
        {
          "line": 38,
          "text": "1. 拉取 `deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness` 最新官方 `master`。"
        },
        {
          "line": 39,
          "text": "2. 记录："
        },
        {
          "line": 40,
          "text": "   - upstream HEAD SHA；"
        },
        {
          "line": 41,
          "text": "   - 本项目 dev HEAD；"
        },
        {
          "line": 42,
          "text": "   - 当前 Goal 主 worktree HEAD；"
        },
        {
          "line": 43,
          "text": "   - 所有迁移/compat/trust/settings/session worktree HEAD；"
        },
        {
          "line": 44,
          "text": "   - merge-base；"
        },
        {
          "line": 45,
          "text": "   - ahead / behind 数；"
        },
        {
          "line": 46,
          "text": "   - dirty/untracked 状态。"
        },
        {
          "line": 47,
          "text": "3. 输出："
        },
        {
          "line": 48,
          "text": "   - `UPSTREAM_BASELINE.md`"
        },
        {
          "line": 49,
          "text": "   - `UPSTREAM_DELTA.json`"
        },
        {
          "line": 50,
          "text": "   - `CUSTOM_CAPABILITY_INVENTORY.json`"
        },
        {
          "line": 51,
          "text": "4. 对官方近期开启/修改的："
        },
        {
          "line": 52,
          "text": "   - `apps/desktop`"
        },
        {
          "line": 53,
          "text": "   - `packages/api`"
        },
        {
          "line": 54,
          "text": "   - `packages/client`"
        },
        {
          "line": 55,
          "text": "   - `packages/client/connection`"
        },
        {
          "line": 56,
          "text": "   - `packages/client/runtime`"
        },
        {
          "line": 57,
          "text": "   - `packages/interaction`"
        },
        {
          "line": 58,
          "text": "   - `packages/session`"
        },
        {
          "line": 59,
          "text": "   - `packages/settings`"
        },
        {
          "line": 60,
          "text": "   - `packages/credentials`"
        },
        {
          "line": 61,
          "text": "   - Desktop packaging/release workflow"
        },
        {
          "line": 62,
          "text": "   做源码级对比。"
        },
        {
          "line": 64,
          "text": "## 1.2 upstream audit 完成前禁止"
        },
        {
          "line": 66,
          "text": "不得继续："
        },
        {
          "line": 68,
          "text": "- 扩展旧 Windows Desktop Host；"
        },
        {
          "line": 69,
          "text": "- 扩展旧 macOS Full Host；"
        },
        {
          "line": 70,
          "text": "- 新增第二套 Desktop updater；"
        },
        {
          "line": 71,
          "text": "- 新增第二套 RPC；"
        },
        {
          "line": 72,
          "text": "- 新建平行 Session protocol；"
        },
        {
          "line": 73,
          "text": "- 新建与 Typert Remote 重叠的 HTTP API；"
        },
        {
          "line": 74,
          "text": "- 扩张 `packages/remote/link-*`；"
        },
        {
          "line": 75,
          "text": "- 改动 Session/schema generation；"
        },
        {
          "line": 76,
          "text": "- 扩大 Device Trust persistence schema；"
        },
        {
          "line": 77,
          "text": "- 增加 Apple/Android Remote API；"
        },
        {
          "line": 78,
          "text": "- 扩展 Lite Tool Contract；"
        },
        {
          "line": 79,
          "text": "- 对 RC Gate 做最终定型；"
        },
        {
          "line": 80,
          "text": "- 继续在旧 SHA 上做大规模 UI。"
        },
        {
          "line": 82,
          "text": "原因："
        },
        {
          "line": 84,
          "text": "> 官方 upstream 已经发生明显架构演进。继续在旧基线上开发，会不断制造未来必须重写的代码。"
        },
        {
          "line": 86,
          "text": "---"
        }
      ],
      "verificationStatus": "NOT_STARTED",
      "acceptanceProven": false,
      "owner": "Upstream 基线与差异审计",
      "candidateEvidence": [
        "UPSTREAM_DELTA.json",
