      ],
      "remaining": "Gate 0 已有来源审计证据；仍需将本章每项记录义务与具体字段逐项对应，不能把 Gate 0 推广为产品完成。",
      "evidenceLimit": "这些路径是已定位的候选证据；尚未逐条证明本节每一项要求，不授予整节 PASS。"
    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "title": "官方 upstream 应作为新的架构基准",
      "lineStart": 88,
      "lineEnd": 161,
      "sourceUnits": [
        {
          "line": 88,
          "text": "# 2. 官方 upstream 应作为新的架构基准"
        },
        {
          "line": 90,
          "text": "当前官方架构应被视为本项目的“真源”。"
        },
        {
          "line": 92,
          "text": "官方目前已经形成几个非常重要的边界："
        },
        {
          "line": 94,
          "text": "### Agent / Host"
        },
        {
          "line": 96,
          "text": "Agent Core、Tool、Session、Interaction 等运行在 Host。"
        },
        {
          "line": 98,
          "text": "### Session"
        },
        {
          "line": 100,
          "text": "Session 是 append-only / event-sourced 的持久真源。"
        },
        {
          "line": 102,
          "text": "不要让："
        },
        {
          "line": 104,
          "text": "- Mobile；"
        },
        {
          "line": 105,
          "text": "- Electron renderer；"
        },
        {
          "line": 106,
          "text": "- Remote transport；"
        },
        {
          "line": 107,
          "text": "- Handoff；"
        },
        {
          "line": 108,
          "text": "- Relay"
        },
        {
          "line": 110,
          "text": "自己维护另一份 Session 真相。"
        },
        {
          "line": 112,
          "text": "### API"
        },
        {
          "line": 114,
          "text": "优先使用官方当前 Typert Remote/API Gateway。"
        },
        {
          "line": 116,
          "text": "普通 RPC："
        },
        {
          "line": 118,
          "text": "> 使用官方 Remote Contract。"
        },
        {
          "line": 120,
          "text": "流式数据："
        },
        {
          "line": 122,
          "text": "> 使用官方 stream/mux/Connection carrier。"
        },
        {
          "line": 124,
          "text": "禁止随意增加："
        },
        {
          "line": 126,
          "text": "`POST /custom/...`"
        },
        {
          "line": 128,
          "text": "这种平行 API。"
        },
        {
          "line": 130,
          "text": "### Client"
        },
        {
          "line": 132,
          "text": "Client business state 应继续围绕："
        },
        {
          "line": 134,
          "text": "`ConnectionController → SessionManager → Session`"
        },
        {
          "line": 136,
          "text": "而不是："
        },
        {
          "line": 138,
          "text": "React Component → IPC → 自定义 Host Service。"
        },
        {
          "line": 140,
          "text": "React/UI 组件不得直接承担协议和 Host 状态机。"
        },
        {
          "line": 142,
          "text": "### Desktop"
        },
        {
          "line": 144,
          "text": "官方 Desktop 已经出现，并且架构相当明确："
        },
        {
          "line": 146,
          "text": "- Electron Shell；"
        },
        {
          "line": 147,
          "text": "- 官方 Web Client；"
        },
        {
          "line": 148,
          "text": "- 内置匹配版本 dsh runtime；"
        },
        {
          "line": 149,
          "text": "- 内置 Node/pnpm；"
        },
        {
          "line": 150,
          "text": "- 不监听普通 Web HTTP 端口；"
        },
        {
          "line": 151,
          "text": "- `dsh-app://` 承担 asset/fetch；"
        },
        {
          "line": 152,
          "text": "- framing pipe 处理流式通信；"
        },
        {
          "line": 153,
          "text": "- Node IPC 主要负责生命周期；"
        },
        {
          "line": 154,
          "text": "- Desktop runtime 与 dsh 版本精确绑定。"
        },
        {
          "line": 156,
          "text": "所以："
        },
        {
          "line": 158,
          "text": "> **今后 Windows/macOS Full Runtime 必须以官方 `apps/desktop` 为主。**"
        },
        {
          "line": 160,
          "text": "---"
        }
      ],
      "verificationStatus": "NOT_STARTED",
      "acceptanceProven": false,
      "owner": "官方架构、Host 权威和薄平台壳",
      "candidateEvidence": [
        "docs/architecture.md",
        "ARCHITECTURE_DECISIONS.md"
      ],
      "remaining": "继续按各 owner 核验唯一运行时、Session、RPC 和共享 Client；实验项不等同正式产品验收。",
      "evidenceLimit": "这些路径是已定位的候选证据；尚未逐条证明本节每一项要求，不授予整节 PASS。"
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "title": "当前自研 Desktop 的处理策略",
      "lineStart": 162,
      "lineEnd": 249,
      "sourceUnits": [
        {
          "line": 162,
          "text": "# 3. 当前自研 Desktop 的处理策略"
        },
        {
          "line": 164,
          "text": "这是本轮最重要的架构调整之一。"
        },
        {
          "line": 166,
          "text": "## 3.1 不再维护两套 Full Desktop"
        },
        {
          "line": 168,
          "text": "禁止形成："
        },
        {
          "line": 170,
          "text": "```text"
        },
        {
          "line": 171,
          "text": "官方 apps/desktop"
        },
        {
          "line": 172,
          "text": "        +"
        },
        {
          "line": 173,
          "text": "我们的 Windows Full Runtime"
        },
        {
          "line": 174,
          "text": "        +"
        },
        {
          "line": 175,
          "text": "我们的 Swift macOS Full Runtime"
        },
        {
          "line": 176,
          "text": "```"
        },
        {
          "line": 178,
          "text": "这是长期维护灾难。"
        },
        {
          "line": 180,
          "text": "未来目标："
        },
        {
          "line": 182,
          "text": "```text"
        },
        {
          "line": 183,
          "text": "              Official Harness Host"
        },
        {
          "line": 184,
          "text": "                       │"
        },
        {
          "line": 185,
          "text": "                 apps/desktop"
        },
        {
          "line": 186,
          "text": "                 Electron Shell"
        },
        {
          "line": 187,
          "text": "                ┌──────┴──────┐"
        },
        {
          "line": 188,
          "text": "              Windows        macOS"
        },
        {
          "line": 189,
          "text": "```"
        },
        {
          "line": 191,
          "text": "## 3.2 当前已有 Desktop 功能分五类迁移"
        },
        {
          "line": 193,
          "text": "### A. upstream 已完全覆盖"
        },
        {
          "line": 195,
          "text": "直接删除 downstream 重复实现。"
        },
        {
          "line": 197,
          "text": "例如："
        },
        {
          "line": 199,
          "text": "- runtime 生命周期；"
        },
        {
          "line": 200,
          "text": "- Node runtime；"
        },
        {
          "line": 201,
          "text": "- Web UI host；"
        },
        {
          "line": 202,
          "text": "- Desktop profile；"
        },
        {
          "line": 203,
          "text": "- update infrastructure；"
        },
        {
          "line": 204,
          "text": "- Electron 生命周期；"
        },
        {
          "line": 205,
          "text": "- macOS signing/notarization；"
        },
        {
          "line": 206,
          "text": "- Windows installer；"
        },
        {
          "line": 207,
          "text": "- updater metadata。"
        },
        {
          "line": 209,
          "text": "### B. upstream 有能力但实现不同"
        },
        {
          "line": 211,
          "text": "迁移至 upstream extension point。"
        },
        {
          "line": 213,
          "text": "例如："
        },
        {
          "line": 215,
          "text": "- diagnostics；"
        },
        {
          "line": 216,
          "text": "- health；"
        },
        {
          "line": 217,
          "text": "- plugin status；"
        },
        {
          "line": 218,
          "text": "- runtime recovery；"
        },
        {
          "line": 219,
          "text": "- native menu。"
        },
        {
          "line": 221,
          "text": "### C. downstream 独有且仍有价值"
        },
        {
          "line": 223,
          "text": "作为："
        },
        {
          "line": 225,
          "text": "- Cordis plugin；"
        },
        {
          "line": 226,
          "text": "- shared Host service；"
        },
        {
          "line": 227,
          "text": "- Client plugin；"
        },
        {
          "line": 228,
          "text": "- Desktop-specific adapter"
        },
        {
          "line": 230,
          "text": "重新接入。"
        },
        {
          "line": 232,
          "text": "不得修改 Desktop 主架构。"
        },
        {
          "line": 234,
          "text": "### D. 仅为旧架构存在"
        },
        {
          "line": 236,
          "text": "直接废弃。"
        },
        {
          "line": 238,
          "text": "### E. Experimental"
        },
        {
          "line": 240,
          "text": "移出 production dependency。"
        },
        {
          "line": 242,
          "text": "进入："
        },
        {
          "line": 244,
          "text": "`experiments/`"
        },
        {
          "line": 246,
          "text": "或独立 feature branch。"
        },
        {
          "line": 248,
          "text": "---"
        }
      ],
      "verificationStatus": "NOT_STARTED",
      "acceptanceProven": false,
      "owner": "官方 Desktop 与 updater",
