    {
      "number": 5,
      "title": "Platform 定位必须重新统一",
      "lineStart": 286,
      "lineEnd": 338,
      "sourceUnits": [
        {
          "line": 286,
          "text": "# 5. Platform 定位必须重新统一"
        },
        {
          "line": 288,
          "text": "## Windows"
        },
        {
          "line": 290,
          "text": "角色："
        },
        {
          "line": 292,
          "text": "**Full Host + Desktop Client**"
        },
        {
          "line": 294,
          "text": "基于："
        },
        {
          "line": 296,
          "text": "`apps/desktop`"
        },
        {
          "line": 298,
          "text": "禁止维护第二 Full Runtime。"
        },
        {
          "line": 300,
          "text": "---"
        },
        {
          "line": 302,
          "text": "## macOS"
        },
        {
          "line": 304,
          "text": "同 Windows："
        },
        {
          "line": 306,
          "text": "**Full Host + Desktop Client**"
        },
        {
          "line": 308,
          "text": "官方 Electron Desktop 为主。"
        },
        {
          "line": 310,
          "text": "原 Swift Full Host："
        },
        {
          "line": 312,
          "text": "> 不再作为主要生产路线。"
        },
        {
          "line": 314,
          "text": "如果 Swift 代码继续保留，只允许承担："
        },
        {
          "line": 316,
          "text": "- native Companion；"
        },
        {
          "line": 317,
          "text": "- Keychain；"
        },
        {
          "line": 318,
          "text": "- push；"
        },
        {
          "line": 319,
          "text": "- share extension；"
        },
        {
          "line": 320,
          "text": "- deep link；"
        },
        {
          "line": 321,
          "text": "- platform integration。"
        },
        {
          "line": 323,
          "text": "---"
        },
        {
          "line": 325,
          "text": "## Linux"
        },
        {
          "line": 327,
          "text": "保持："
        },
        {
          "line": 329,
          "text": "**CLI + Web Host**"
        },
        {
          "line": 331,
          "text": "官方没有成熟 Linux Desktop 之前："
        },
        {
          "line": 333,
          "text": "不得为了“平台完整”强行维护第三套 Desktop release。"
        },
        {
          "line": 335,
          "text": "未来 Linux Desktop 单独做 ADR 后再决定。"
        },
        {
          "line": 337,
          "text": "---"
        }
      ],
      "verificationStatus": "NOT_STARTED",
      "acceptanceProven": false,
      "owner": "官方架构、Host 权威和薄平台壳",
      "candidateEvidence": [
        "docs/architecture.md",
        "ARCHITECTURE_DECISIONS.md"
      ],
      "remaining": "继续按各 owner 核验唯一运行时、Session、RPC 和共享 Client；实验项不等同正式产品验收。",
      "evidenceLimit": "这些路径是已定位的候选证据；尚未逐条证明本节每一项要求，不授予整节 PASS。"
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "title": "Mobile 产品定位重新定义",
      "lineStart": 339,
      "lineEnd": 426,
      "sourceUnits": [
        {
          "line": 339,
          "text": "# 6. Mobile 产品定位重新定义"
        },
        {
          "line": 341,
          "text": "Mobile 分三级。"
        },
        {
          "line": 343,
          "text": "## Level A：Remote Companion"
        },
        {
          "line": 345,
          "text": "优先级最高。"
        },
        {
          "line": 347,
          "text": "手机："
        },
        {
          "line": 349,
          "text": "- 不执行完整 Agent Runtime；"
        },
        {
          "line": 350,
          "text": "- 不直接访问开发目录；"
        },
        {
          "line": 351,
          "text": "- 连接 Windows/macOS/Linux Host；"
        },
        {
          "line": 352,
          "text": "- 查看 Agent；"
        },
        {
          "line": 353,
          "text": "- 发送 Prompt；"
        },
        {
          "line": 354,
          "text": "- Answer question；"
        },
        {
          "line": 355,
          "text": "- Approve；"
        },
        {
          "line": 356,
          "text": "- Follow；"
        },
        {
          "line": 357,
          "text": "- Handoff；"
        },
        {
          "line": 358,
          "text": "- 查看 Diff / Artifact；"
        },
        {
          "line": 359,
          "text": "- 切 Host；"
        },
        {
          "line": 360,
          "text": "- 收通知。"
        },
        {
          "line": 362,
          "text": "这是 iOS 和 Android 的默认模式。"
        },
        {
          "line": 364,
          "text": "---"
        },
        {
          "line": 366,
          "text": "## Level B：Lite Runtime"
        },
        {
          "line": 368,
          "text": "仅提供经过明确限制的一小部分本地能力。"
        },
        {
          "line": 370,
          "text": "例如："
        },
        {
          "line": 372,
          "text": "- simple note；"
        },
        {
          "line": 373,
          "text": "- structured tasks；"
        },
        {
          "line": 374,
          "text": "- artifact；"
        },
        {
          "line": 375,
          "text": "- restricted local tool；"
        },
        {
          "line": 376,
          "text": "- sandboxed files。"
        },
        {
          "line": 378,
          "text": "不得伪装成 Full Host。"
        },
        {
          "line": 380,
          "text": "必须公开："
        },
        {
          "line": 382,
          "text": "`runtimeMode = lite`"
        },
        {
          "line": 384,
          "text": "---"
        },
        {
          "line": 386,
          "text": "## Level C：Full Mobile Host"
        },
        {
          "line": 388,
          "text": "只作为长期实验。"
        },
        {
          "line": 390,
          "text": "### Android"
        },
        {
          "line": 392,
          "text": "技术上存在实现可能性，但："
        },
        {
          "line": 394,
          "text": "- Node；"
        },
        {
          "line": 395,
          "text": "- PRoot；"
        },
        {
          "line": 396,
          "text": "- sandbox；"
        },
        {
          "line": 397,
          "text": "- process lifecycle；"
        },
        {
          "line": 398,
          "text": "- Android background restriction；"
        },
        {
          "line": 399,
          "text": "- APK size；"
        },
        {
          "line": 400,
          "text": "- native dependency；"
        },
        {
          "line": 401,
          "text": "- plugin；"
        },
        {
          "line": 402,
          "text": "- update；"
        },
        {
          "line": 403,
          "text": "- Play policy"
        },
        {
          "line": 405,
          "text": "复杂度都很高。"
        },
        {
          "line": 407,
          "text": "所以列为："
        },
        {
          "line": 409,
          "text": "**P3 Experimental**"
        },
        {
          "line": 411,
          "text": "### iOS"
        },
        {
          "line": 413,
          "text": "Full Host 暂不作为正式产品目标。"
        },
        {
          "line": 415,
          "text": "主要受："
        },
        {
          "line": 417,
          "text": "- process；"
        },
        {
          "line": 418,
          "text": "- JIT/runtime；"
        },
        {
          "line": 419,
          "text": "- filesystem；"
        },
        {
          "line": 420,
          "text": "- background execution；"
        },
        {
          "line": 421,
          "text": "- App Store"
        },
        {
          "line": 423,
          "text": "等平台限制影响。"
        },
        {
          "line": 425,
          "text": "---"
        }
      ],
      "verificationStatus": "NOT_STARTED",
      "acceptanceProven": false,
      "owner": "共享 Client 响应式与原生输入",
      "candidateEvidence": [
        "PLATFORM_VERIFICATION.md",
        "docs/plans/2026-09-14-upstream-first.zh.md"
      ],
      "remaining": "尚无规格要求的完整尺寸/主题/状态/访问性矩阵，以及 iOS/Android 真机输入、后台与原生附件验收。",
      "evidenceLimit": "这些路径是已定位的候选证据；尚未逐条证明本节每一项要求，不授予整节 PASS。"
    },
    {
      "number": 7,
      "title": "第一阶段 P0：把 Web Client 做成真正跨端 Client",
      "lineStart": 427,
      "lineEnd": 484,
      "sourceUnits": [
        {
          "line": 427,
          "text": "# 7. 第一阶段 P0：把 Web Client 做成真正跨端 Client"
        },
        {
          "line": 429,
          "text": "在做更多 Native UI 前，必须把官方 Web Client 做好。"
        },
        {
          "line": 431,
          "text": "原因："
        },
        {
          "line": 433,
          "text": "官方 Web Client 本身就是 Desktop 的 UI。"
        },
        {
          "line": 435,
          "text": "如果 Web Client 支持优秀的："
        },
        {
          "line": 437,
          "text": "- Phone；"
        },
        {
          "line": 438,
          "text": "- Tablet；"
        },
        {
          "line": 439,
          "text": "- Desktop；"
        },
        {
          "line": 440,
          "text": "- Touch；"
        },
        {
          "line": 441,
          "text": "- Keyboard；"
        },
        {
          "line": 443,
          "text": "那么："
        },
        {
          "line": 445,
          "text": "Windows / macOS / Web / PWA"
        },
        {
          "line": 447,
          "text": "自动获得一致体验。"
        },
        {
          "line": 449,
          "text": "## Breakpoint 建议"
        },
        {
          "line": 451,
          "text": "### Phone"
        },
        {
          "line": 453,
          "text": "`< 600px`"
        },
        {
          "line": 455,
          "text": "- Sidebar → Overlay Drawer；"
        },
        {
          "line": 456,
          "text": "- Right Panel → Sheet / fullscreen；"
        },
        {
          "line": 457,
          "text": "- Conversation 全宽；"
        },
        {
          "line": 458,
          "text": "- Composer sticky；"
        },
        {
          "line": 459,
          "text": "- 不允许 persistent sidebar 压缩聊天区域。"
        },
        {
          "line": 461,
          "text": "### Large Phone / Small Tablet"
        },
        {
          "line": 463,
          "text": "`600–839`"
        },
        {
          "line": 465,
          "text": "- compact rail / drawer；"
        },
        {
          "line": 466,
          "text": "- inspector overlay；"
        },
        {
          "line": 467,
          "text": "- Composer adaptive。"
        },
        {
          "line": 469,
          "text": "### Tablet"
        },
        {
          "line": 471,
          "text": "`840–1023`"
        },
        {
          "line": 473,
          "text": "- collapsible rail；"
        },
        {
          "line": 474,
          "text": "- 主 Conversation；"
        },
        {
          "line": 475,
          "text": "- inspector 可 overlay。"
        },
        {
          "line": 477,
          "text": "### Desktop"
        },
        {
          "line": 479,
          "text": "`>= 1024`"
        },
        {
          "line": 481,
          "text": "使用官方现有 Desktop layout。"
        },
        {
          "line": 483,
          "text": "---"
        }
      ],
      "verificationStatus": "NOT_STARTED",
      "acceptanceProven": false,
      "owner": "共享 Client 响应式与原生输入",
