          "text": "# 11. Cross-device 第一原则"
        },
        {
          "line": 628,
          "text": "## View 可以移动"
        },
        {
          "line": 630,
          "text": "执行位置不能隐式移动。"
        },
        {
          "line": 632,
          "text": "例如："
        },
        {
          "line": 634,
          "text": "用户在："
        },
        {
          "line": 636,
          "text": "Windows"
        },
        {
          "line": 638,
          "text": "启动 Session。"
        },
        {
          "line": 640,
          "text": "然后 iPhone 打开："
        },
        {
          "line": 642,
          "text": "Session 仍运行在 Windows。"
        },
        {
          "line": 644,
          "text": "---"
