          "text": "Relay 推荐："
        },
        {
          "line": 965,
          "text": "Host："
        },
        {
          "line": 967,
          "text": "主动 outbound connect Relay。"
        },
        {
          "line": 969,
          "text": "而不是："
        },
        {
          "line": 971,
          "text": "Host 开公网端口。"
        },
