    {
      "number": 49,
      "title": "15 项旧遗留重新评估",
      "lineStart": 1619,
      "lineEnd": 1822,
      "sourceUnits": [
        {
          "line": 1619,
          "text": "# 49. 15 项旧遗留重新评估"
        },
        {
          "line": 1621,
          "text": "## 1. macOS Direct Full Host"
        },
        {
          "line": 1623,
          "text": "原状态："
        },
        {
          "line": 1625,
          "text": "部分实现。"
        },
        {
          "line": 1627,
          "text": "新结论："
        },
        {
          "line": 1629,
          "text": "**不再作为主产品路线。**"
        },
        {
          "line": 1631,
          "text": "官方 Desktop 已经存在。"
        },
        {
          "line": 1633,
          "text": "行动："
        },
        {
          "line": 1635,
          "text": "- 功能差异审计；"
        },
        {
          "line": 1636,
          "text": "- 有价值能力迁到 official Desktop/service；"
        },
        {
          "line": 1637,
          "text": "- Swift Full Host 降为 Experimental；"
        },
        {
          "line": 1638,
          "text": "- 禁止继续扩大。"
        },
        {
          "line": 1640,
          "text": "---"
        },
        {
          "line": 1642,
          "text": "## 2. iPhone / Android 真机 E2E"
        },
        {
          "line": 1644,
          "text": "继续。"
        },
        {
          "line": 1646,
          "text": "优先级："
        },
        {
          "line": 1648,
          "text": "**P1**"
        },
        {
          "line": 1650,
          "text": "必须覆盖真实设备。"
        },
        {
          "line": 1652,
          "text": "---"
        },
        {
          "line": 1654,
          "text": "## 3. Lite 内置 Tool Execution"
        },
        {
          "line": 1656,
          "text": "继续，但延后。"
        },
        {
          "line": 1658,
          "text": "优先级："
        },
        {
          "line": 1660,
          "text": "P2。"
        },
        {
          "line": 1662,
          "text": "先稳定："
        },
        {
          "line": 1664,
          "text": "Remote Contract。"
        },
        {
          "line": 1666,
          "text": "---"
        },
        {
          "line": 1668,
          "text": "## 4. Lite Persona"
        },
        {
          "line": 1670,
          "text": "继续。"
        },
        {
          "line": 1672,
          "text": "P2。"
        },
        {
          "line": 1674,
          "text": "复用官方 Prompt/Context composition。"
        },
        {
          "line": 1676,
          "text": "---"
        },
        {
          "line": 1678,
          "text": "## 5. mDNS / Bonjour"
        },
        {
          "line": 1680,
          "text": "继续，但降级。"
        },
        {
          "line": 1682,
          "text": "P2。"
        },
        {
          "line": 1684,
          "text": "只是 discovery convenience。"
        },
        {
          "line": 1686,
          "text": "不能参与 trust。"
        },
        {
          "line": 1688,
          "text": "---"
        },
        {
          "line": 1690,
          "text": "## 6. Capability / Version Negotiation"
        },
        {
          "line": 1692,
          "text": "升级为："
        },
        {
          "line": 1694,
          "text": "**P0。**"
        },
        {
          "line": 1696,
          "text": "这是所有跨端能力基础。"
        },
        {
          "line": 1698,
          "text": "---"
        },
        {
          "line": 1700,
          "text": "## 7. Windows Role Editing / Diagnostics"
        },
        {
          "line": 1702,
          "text": "拆分。"
        },
        {
          "line": 1704,
          "text": "Diagnostics："
        },
        {
          "line": 1706,
          "text": "P1，共享实现。"
        },
        {
          "line": 1708,
          "text": "Role Editing："
        },
        {
          "line": 1710,
          "text": "移到 Device Management UI。"
        },
        {
          "line": 1712,
          "text": "不再 Windows-only。"
        },
        {
          "line": 1714,
          "text": "---"
        },
        {
          "line": 1716,
          "text": "## 8. iPad / Android Adaptive Layout"
        },
        {
          "line": 1718,
          "text": "提升："
        },
        {
          "line": 1720,
          "text": "Web Responsive = P0。"
        },
        {
          "line": 1722,
          "text": "Native Adaptive = P2。"
        },
        {
          "line": 1724,
          "text": "---"
        },
        {
          "line": 1726,
          "text": "## 9. Diff Line Number / Highlight"
        },
        {
          "line": 1728,
          "text": "P2/P3。"
        },
        {
          "line": 1730,
          "text": "共享 viewer。"
        },
        {
          "line": 1732,
          "text": "---"
        },
        {
          "line": 1734,
          "text": "## 10. 统一 HarnessRuntime"
        },
        {
          "line": 1736,
          "text": "原方案需要改变。"
        },
        {
          "line": 1738,
          "text": "不要创建一个庞大的自定义 `HarnessRuntime` Facade 覆盖官方 runtime。"
        },
        {
          "line": 1740,
          "text": "真正需要统一的是："
        },
        {
          "line": 1742,
          "text": "```text"
        },
        {
          "line": 1743,
          "text": "Host Contract"
        },
        {
          "line": 1744,
          "text": "Connection"
        },
        {
          "line": 1745,
          "text": "Session"
        },
        {
          "line": 1746,
          "text": "Interaction"
        },
        {
          "line": 1747,
          "text": "Capabilities"
        },
        {
          "line": 1748,
          "text": "```"
        },
        {
          "line": 1750,
          "text": "因此："
        },
        {
          "line": 1752,
          "text": "> **概念保留，实现方式推倒重审。**"
        },
        {
          "line": 1754,
          "text": "---"
        },
        {
          "line": 1756,
          "text": "## 11. Session Running Location / Multi Host"
        },
        {
          "line": 1758,
          "text": "P1。"
        },
        {
          "line": 1760,
          "text": "继续。"
        },
        {
          "line": 1762,
          "text": "对移动端非常重要。"
        },
        {
          "line": 1764,
          "text": "---"
        },
        {
          "line": 1766,
          "text": "## 12. Follow / Private Network UX"
        },
        {
          "line": 1768,
          "text": "P1。"
        },
        {
          "line": 1770,
          "text": "Follow 继续。"
        },
        {
          "line": 1772,
          "text": "Private Network 则重构为："
        },
        {
          "line": 1774,
          "text": "Transport + Trust。"
        },
        {
          "line": 1776,
          "text": "---"
        },
        {
          "line": 1778,
          "text": "## 13. Network / Compatibility Matrix"
        },
        {
          "line": 1780,
          "text": "提升为："
        },
        {
          "line": 1782,
          "text": "**P0 Gate。**"
        },
        {
          "line": 1784,
          "text": "不能只测试 Kotlin。"
        },
        {
          "line": 1786,
          "text": "必须最终覆盖："
        },
        {
          "line": 1788,
          "text": "- TS/Web；"
        },
        {
          "line": 1789,
          "text": "- Desktop；"
        },
        {
          "line": 1790,
          "text": "- Swift；"
        },
        {
          "line": 1791,
          "text": "- Kotlin。"
        },
        {
          "line": 1793,
          "text": "---"
        },
        {
          "line": 1795,
          "text": "## 14. Steer / Model Read-Select"
        },
        {
          "line": 1797,
          "text": "P1。"
        },
        {
          "line": 1799,
          "text": "放进统一 Remote API 和共享 UI。"
        },
        {
          "line": 1801,
          "text": "---"
        },
        {
          "line": 1803,
          "text": "## 15. Health / Contract Stability / Command Risk"
        },
        {
          "line": 1805,
          "text": "提升："
        },
        {
          "line": 1807,
          "text": "P0/P1。"
        },
        {
          "line": 1809,
          "text": "Health / Readiness："
        },
        {
          "line": 1811,
          "text": "P1。"
        },
        {
          "line": 1813,
          "text": "Version Contract："
        },
        {
          "line": 1815,
          "text": "P0。"
        },
        {
          "line": 1817,
          "text": "Command Risk："
        },
        {
          "line": 1819,
          "text": "P0/P1。"
        },
        {
          "line": 1821,
          "text": "---"
        }
      ],
      "verificationStatus": "NOT_STARTED",
      "acceptanceProven": false,
      "owner": "旧能力处置与新增可靠性边界",
