    {
      "number": 74,
      "title": "Stop Condition",
      "lineStart": 2711,
      "lineEnd": 2740,
      "sourceUnits": [
        {
          "line": 2711,
          "text": "# 74. Stop Condition"
        },
        {
          "line": 2713,
          "text": "Agent 遇到以下情况必须停止继续堆功能并转为报告："
        },
        {
          "line": 2715,
          "text": "### Upstream architecture conflict"
        },
        {
          "line": 2717,
          "text": "例如官方刚重写 API。"
        },
        {
          "line": 2719,
          "text": "### Persistence ambiguity"
        },
        {
          "line": 2721,
          "text": "不知道哪套数据是真源。"
        },
        {
          "line": 2723,
          "text": "### Security boundary unclear"
        },
        {
          "line": 2725,
          "text": "尤其 Device Trust/Remote。"
        },
        {
          "line": 2727,
          "text": "### Current candidate SHA mismatch"
        },
        {
          "line": 2729,
          "text": "不能继续假装 RC。"
        },
        {
          "line": 2731,
          "text": "### Native runner unavailable"
        },
        {
          "line": 2733,
          "text": "不得把 simulator 当物理设备通过。"
        },
        {
          "line": 2735,
          "text": "### Signing unavailable"
        },
        {
          "line": 2737,
          "text": "不得把 unsigned artifact 标为 release pass。"
        },
        {
          "line": 2739,
          "text": "---"
        }
      ],
