    {
      "number": 80,
      "title": "最终成功标准",
      "lineStart": 3047,
      "lineEnd": 3101,
      "sourceUnits": [
        {
          "line": 3047,
          "text": "# 80. 最终成功标准"
        },
        {
          "line": 3049,
          "text": "整个项目最终达到："
        },
        {
          "line": 3051,
          "text": "### Upstream"
        },
        {
          "line": 3053,
          "text": "可以持续同步官方而不发生大面积冲突。"
        },
        {
          "line": 3055,
          "text": "### Architecture"
        },
        {
          "line": 3057,
          "text": "不存在两套 Full Desktop/Session/RPC。"
        },
        {
          "line": 3059,
          "text": "### Cross-device"
        },
        {
          "line": 3061,
          "text": "Win / Mac / Linux Host："
        },
        {
          "line": 3063,
          "text": "可被 Web / Desktop / iPhone / iPad / Android 安全访问。"
        },
        {
          "line": 3065,
          "text": "### Reliability"
        },
        {
          "line": 3067,
          "text": "断网、后台、Host restart 后可恢复。"
        },
        {
          "line": 3069,
          "text": "### Security"
        },
        {
          "line": 3071,
          "text": "Remote 不以降低 local Host 安全为代价。"
        },
        {
          "line": 3073,
          "text": "### UX"
        },
        {
          "line": 3075,
          "text": "所有端信息架构一致。"
        },
        {
          "line": 3077,
          "text": "### Mobile"
        },
        {
          "line": 3079,
          "text": "Phone/Tablet 真正可用，而不是“桌面网页缩小版”。"
        },
        {
          "line": 3081,
          "text": "### Compatibility"
        },
        {
          "line": 3083,
          "text": "N / N-1 自动验证。"
        },
        {
          "line": 3085,
          "text": "### Release"
        },
        {
          "line": 3087,
          "text": "同 SHA、签名、SBOM、provenance、真实 Runner/真机。"
        },
        {
          "line": 3089,
          "text": "### Maintainability"
        },
        {
          "line": 3091,
          "text": "平台 Shell 薄，业务逻辑集中。"
        },
        {
          "line": 3093,
          "text": "### Future Upstreamability"
        },
        {
          "line": 3095,
          "text": "新增能力尽量遵循官方 package ownership、Cordis、Typert、Client Runtime 和设计规范，从而让未来 upstream 采用或我们持续 rebase 的成本尽可能低。"
        },
        {
          "line": 3097,
          "text": "---"
        },
        {
          "line": 3099,
          "text": "# 本轮一句话总原则"
        },
        {
          "line": 3101,
          "text": "**不要继续把 DeepSeek Harness 做成“五套客户端各自带一套 Harness”；应把它收敛为“一套官方兼容 Harness 平台 + 一套跨端 Contract + 多个轻量 Shell”。**"
        }
      ],
